# Pao on Daisangen won by Ron from a THIRD PARTY (engine.md §4.2, rules.md §1, §4.31).
# Round starts with honba=1 (300 on ron).
# Seat 2 feeds the 3rd dragon (7z) to Seat 1 (Pao against Seat 2).
# Later Seat 3 (third party) discards 4m -> Seat 1 rons 4m (Daisangen = 32000 + 300 honba).
# Split: Seat 2 (liable) pays 50% (16000) + honba (300) = -16300;
#        Seat 3 (discarder) pays 50% (16000) = -16000;
#        Seat 1 receives +32300.

